    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43268" root="لحى" body-key="l">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَحْىٌ</span></b>  [not <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَحًى</span>] The <i>jaw-bone;</i> (Mgh, Msb;)
either <i>upper or lower:</i> (Msb:) and, in a man,
(Msb,) the <i>part on which the beard grows.</i> (S,
Msb, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And sometimes <i>Either lateral portion of the lower jaw:</i> see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ذَقَنٌ</span>, and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الفَنِيكُ</span>.

